From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:10:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Keep the TEE Simulator off until it is switched on

Picking target apps writes the keystore config, and with no config yet it
wrote enabled=1, so the TEE Simulator could turn on while its switch
still showed off. Start from enabled=0; an existing config keeps its
value.

Change-Id: I16a548766f1ee724f2ce9492a5ad528a0ab2ab8c
---
 .../android/settings/custom/spoofing/TeeSimulatorAppSettings.kt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/com/android/settings/custom/spoofing/TeeSimulatorAppSettings.kt b/src/com/android/settings/custom/spoofing/TeeSimulatorAppSettings.kt
index f4553067f4a..a23834549fc 100644
--- a/src/com/android/settings/custom/spoofing/TeeSimulatorAppSettings.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/settings/custom/spoofing/TeeSimulatorAppSettings.kt
@@ -234,7 +234,7 @@ private fun TeeSimulatorAppSettingsContent(
         try {
             val storeDir = File(TeeSimulatorAppSettings.STORE_DIR)
             val configFile = File(storeDir, TeeSimulatorAppSettings.CONFIG_FILE)
-            var enabled = "1"
+            var enabled = "0"
             var mode = "auto"
             var keyboxPath = File(storeDir, "keybox.xml").absolutePath
             var showSys = "0"
-- 
2.43.0

